{"3796570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Putt It In Orbit", "steam_appid": 3796570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Putt It In Orbit is a putt-tastic adventure through galaxies with different inhabitants and environments. Putt the ball hard to launch it into orbit and see if you can chip it into the hole. This game features tracks with multiple options for reaching the hole—plan by rotating the planet to strategize the best way to putt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Themed Galaxies!</strong> 3 themed galaxies and more to come. Can you find all the secrets hidden in  these worlds?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/extras/542b1e654af2b39985160021f0913c8c.poster.avif?t=1770048025\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/extras/542b1e654af2b39985160021f0913c8c.webm?t=1770048025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/extras/542b1e654af2b39985160021f0913c8c.mp4?t=1770048025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotate to Explore!</strong> With controls to help you explore and find the most optimal path to the hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/extras/459f9b524b9789b65e092675bf734ed1.poster.avif?t=1770048025\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/extras/459f9b524b9789b65e092675bf734ed1.webm?t=1770048025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/extras/459f9b524b9789b65e092675bf734ed1.mp4?t=1770048025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Putt It In Orbit is a putt-tastic adventure through galaxies with different inhabitants and environments. Putt the ball hard to launch it into orbit and see if you can chip it into the hole. This game features tracks with multiple options for reaching the hole—plan by rotating the planet to strategize the best way to putt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Themed Galaxies!</strong> 3 themed galaxies and more to come. Can you find all the secrets hidden in  these worlds?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/extras/542b1e654af2b39985160021f0913c8c.poster.avif?t=1770048025\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/extras/542b1e654af2b39985160021f0913c8c.webm?t=1770048025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/extras/542b1e654af2b39985160021f0913c8c.mp4?t=1770048025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotate to Explore!</strong> With controls to help you explore and find the most optimal path to the hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/extras/459f9b524b9789b65e092675bf734ed1.poster.avif?t=1770048025\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/extras/459f9b524b9789b65e092675bf734ed1.webm?t=1770048025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/extras/459f9b524b9789b65e092675bf734ed1.mp4?t=1770048025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Play golf now with this super fun and cute orbital golf! Explore different planets, annoy the neighbors, and see how many levels you can make par on. Launch the ball into orbit and see if you can chip the ball in with Putt It In Orbit!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/1674b960dd22cadadad5ecbb570f642c63aabe9b/header.jpg?t=1770048025", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/235cdf6765e4563097935db387dfbdeaf923a5e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770048025", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/235cdf6765e4563097935db387dfbdeaf923a5e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770048025", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8/8.1, 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128mb Video Memory, capable of Shader Model 2.0+<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8/8.1, 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 3.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong